2
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Jiu Jitsu is a action, science fiction, fantasy
film directed by Dimitri Logothetis.

3
00:18:00,000 --> 00:18:06,000
Every six years, an ancient order of jiu-jitsu fighters joins
forces to battle a vicious race of alien invaders.

4
00:24:00,000 --> 00:24:06,000
But when a celebrated war hero goes down in defeat, the fate of
the planet and mankind hangs in the balance.

