11
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:06,000
Jiu Jitsu is a 2020 American science fiction martial arts film directed by
Dimitri Logothetis, who co-wrote the screenplay with James McGrath.

12
01:12:00,000 --> 01:12:06,000
It is based on the 2017 comic book of the same name by Logothetis and McGrath.

13
01:18:00,000 --> 01:18:06,000
It stars Alain Moussi, Frank Grillo, JuJu Chan, Tony Jaa and Nicolas Cage.

14
01:24:00,000 --> 01:24:06,000
It was a box office bomb, grossing less than $100,000 against a
budget of $25 million, and was critically panned.

15
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
The film explores themes of martial arts, based on comic, jiu-jitsu.

16
01:36:00,000 --> 01:36:06,000
The tone is thought_provoking.
